          "title": "Citigroup raises AI capex and revenue forecasts amid rapid enterprise adoption",
          "summary": "Citigroup raised its global AI capital expenditure forecast for 2026-2030 to about $8.9 trillion and lifted the AI-related revenue forecast for 2026-2030 to about $3.3 trillion, citing faster enterprise demand and adoption. The bank noted stronger-than-expected AI tool usage across its client base and ongoing investments in AI infrastructure and analytics. The update signals that major banks are embedding AI across products, risk management, and operations as a key growth driver. The move signals how AI is reshaping capital allocation and revenue outlooks among large financial institutions.",
